    - target: {fileID: 8349371559056886678, guid: c9ca0fec133f6ce45883a6c95eef7088, type: 3}
      propertyPath: answerTargets.Array.size
      value: 13
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8349371559056886678, guid: c9ca0fec133f6ce45883a6c95eef7088, type: 3}
      propertyPath: playbackSettings.koreanText
      value: "\uB2F9\uC2E0\uC740 \uAE4A\uC740 \uC232 \uC18D\uC5D0 \uC11C \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n\uC6C0\uC9C1\uC77C
        \uC218\uB294 \uC5C6\uC9C0\uB9CC, \uC0AC\uBC29\uC5D0\uC11C \uB4E4\uB824\uC624\uB294
        \uC18C\uB9AC\uB97C \uD1B5\uD574 \uB2E8\uC11C\uB97C \uCC3E\uC544\uC57C \uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n\uC815\uB2F5\uC744
        \uB9DE\uD788\uB824\uBA74 \uC18C\uB9AC\uC758 \uC885\uB958\uC640 \uADF8 \uC18C\uB9AC\uAC00
        \uB4E4\uB824\uC624\uB294 \uBC29\uD5A5\uC744 \uBAA8\uB450 \uC54C\uC544\uB0B4\uC57C
        \uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n\uD558\uC9C0\uB9CC \uC9C4\uC9DC \uB2E8\uC11C\uB294 \uC232\uACFC
        \uC5B4\uC6B8\uB9AC\uC9C0 \uC54A\uB294 \uC774\uC9C8\uC801\uC778 \uC18C\uB9AC\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n\uC790\uC5F0\uC2A4\uB7EC\uC6B4
        \uC232\uC758 \uC18C\uB9AC\uB4E4\uC740 \uD568\uC815\uC774\uB2C8 \uC870\uC2EC\uD558\uC138\uC694.\n\uC54C\uD30C\uBCB3
        4\uAC1C\uB97C \uBAA8\uC544 \uB2E8\uC5B4\uB97C \uC644\uC131\uD558\uACE0 \uC232\uC744
        \uD0C8\uCD9C\uD558\uC138\uC694.\n\uADC0\uB97C \uAE30\uC6B8\uC5EC \uBCF4\uC138\uC694..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8349371559056886678, guid: c9ca0fec133f6ce45883a6c95eef7088, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'answerTargets.Array.data[12]'
      value: "\uB2F5"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8349371559056886678, guid: c9ca0fec133f6ce45883a6c95eef7088, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'answerTargets.Array.data[13]'
      value: "\uB2F5"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8349371559056886678, guid: c9ca0fec133f6ce45883a6c95eef7088, type: 3}
      propertyPath: playbackSettings.englishText
      value: 'You are standing deep in the forest.

        You cannot move, but
        you must find clues through the sounds coming from all directions.

        To
        get the correct answer, you must identify both the sound and its 2D direction.

        However,
        the real clues are unusual sounds that don''t belong in the forest.

        Be
        careful, as natural forest sounds are traps.

        Collect 4 alphabets
        to complete the word and escape from the forest.

        Listen carefully...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
